# Deny-all + allowlist. docker/spark-migrated/Dockerfile is the only image built
# from the repo root as its context, and it needs nothing but the migration
# chains and the thin runner beside them. Without this, the context would also
# ship actions-runner/ (~2.3G of self-hosted runner state), .git/, dist/ and
# .pants.d/ to the daemon on every build.
#
# docker/pyspark-validate and docker/spark-connect use their own subdirectory as
# context, so this file does not affect them.
*
!src/__init__.py
!src/crutch_migrations/**
!docker/spark-migrated/register_tables.py
